WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.250
On AWS, the evidence path has
changed under people's feet.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:08.794
Config conformance packs and Security
Hub's posture checks are the foundation,

3
00:00:08.794 --> 00:00:12.512
and both run in GovCloud, though
with differences you need to test.

4
00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:17.437
Security Hub keeps findings for only
ninety days, so copy them out first.

5
00:00:17.437 --> 00:00:22.621
The big correction is Audit Manager: it
closed to new customers in April 2026,

6
00:00:22.621 --> 00:00:28.051
has no GovCloud endpoint, and its FedRAMP
framework is still on the old revision.

7
00:00:28.051 --> 00:00:30.975
Nobody should start a federal
evidence program on it.

8
00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:34.493
And the ServiceNow
connector most agencies used

9
00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:37.925
loses support in March
2027, so plan that move now.

10
00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:39.820
VMware is harder still.
